  "method": "Join fresh native manager defaults to original outgoing AP authentication.\n\nUnchanged manager constructor, credential-entry, language setter, connection\nconfiguration assembly/copy and whole authentication builder execute offline.\nSynthetic credentials, device/model/language and OS facts are inputs. The full\nversion comes from the original root's immutable literal. Standard allocation,\nmemory, strings, uncontended mutexes and crypto reuse the existing providers.\nAsio timer initialization and executor posting are inert; proxy/retry/IO factory\ninterfaces reuse the documented hello-profile oracle boundaries. No original\nprocess, profile, credentials, account, keychain, socket or network is accessed.\n",
